[I] A flexible message logging facility for C++ programs and libraries

[T] RLog is a C++ logging library by Valient Gough that provides message
[T] logging with very low overhead when logging is disabled. Log messages
[T] are organized in channels and components that can be subscribed to
[T] selectively at runtime.

[U] https://code.google.com/archive/p/rlog/

